{"version":1,"content":"<p>1979年香港小姐季軍鍾慧冰（冰姐）近年轉型經營網上頻道，憑知性豁達的形象大受好評。</p><p>即將邁入「古稀之年」的她，近日拍片開箱自己砸重金完成的複式豪宅大翻新，直言這是送給自己迎接70歲的厚禮。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;這座</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.260927+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T12:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"ab1e383518857b13e9b50566ec0e15a59e25c7253edb51f31d892e2315eecd02","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}